  "correctValue": null,
  "solution": {
    "text": "<p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mover><mi>a</mi><mo>&#8594;</mo></mover><mo>&#215;</mo><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mover><mi>b</mi><mo>&#8594;</mo></mover><mo>&#215;</mo><mover><mi>c</mi><mo>&#8594;</mo></mover></mrow></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mover><mi>b</mi><mo>&#8594;</mo></mover><mn>2</mn></mfrac><mo>&#8658;</mo><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mover><mi>a</mi><mo>&#8594;</mo></mover><mo>.</mo><mover><mi>c</mi><mo>&#8594;</mo></mover></mrow></mfenced><mover><mi>b</mi><mo>&#8594;</mo></mover><mo>-</mo><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mover><mi>a</mi><mo>&#8594;</mo></mover><mo>.</mo><mover><mi>b</mi><mo>&#8594;</mo></mover></mrow></mfenced><mover><mi>c</mi><mo>&#8594;</mo></mover><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mover><mi>b</mi><mo>&#8594;</mo></mover><mn>2</mn></mfrac></math></p><p>Since,&nbsp;<math><mover accent=\"true\"><mrow><mi>b</mi></mrow><mo>&#8594;</mo></mover></math> is not parallel to <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mover><mi>c</mi><mo>&#8594;</mo></mover><mo>&#8658;</mo><mover><mi>a</mi><mo>&#8594;</mo></mover><mo>.</mo><mover><mi>c</mi><mo>&#8594;</mo></mover><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mn>2</mn></mfrac><mo>&#8658;</mo><mfenced close=\"|\" open=\"|\"><mi>a</mi></mfenced><mfenced close=\"|\" open=\"|\"><mi>c</mi></mfenced><mi>cos</mi><mi>&#946;</mi><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mn>2</mn></mfrac><mo>&#8658;</mo><mi>cos</mi><mi>&#946;</mi><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mn>2</mn></mfrac></math> and</p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mover><mi>a</mi><mo>&#8594;</mo></mover><mo>.</mo><mover><mi>b</mi><mo>&#8594;</mo></mover><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn><mo>&#8658;</mo><mfenced close=\"|\" open=\"|\"><mi>a</mi></mfenced><mfenced close=\"|\" open=\"|\"><mi>b</mi></mfenced><mi>cos</mi><mi>&#945;</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn><mo>&#8658;</mo><mi>cos</mi><mi>&#945;</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><mi>&#946;</mi><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mi>&#960;</mi><mn>3</mn></mfrac></math>&nbsp;and&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>&#945;</mi><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mi>&#960;</mi><mn>2</mn></mfrac></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8756;</mo><mfenced close=\"|\" open=\"|\"><mrow><mi>&#945;</mi><mo>-</mo><mi>&#946;</mi></mrow></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&#960;</mi><mn>2</mn></mfrac><mo>-</mo><mfrac><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&#960;</mi><mn>3</mn></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&#960;</mi><mn>6</mn></mfrac></math></p>",
